BT 72 720 Td 14 TL /F1 12 Tf (GraphWeave: A Synthetic Survey of Message-Passing Graph Neural Networks) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf () Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Ada Corvin, Mira Okafor, and Deniz Yilmaz) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Institute for Synthetic Graph Learning. All content is fictional and produced) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (solely as a retrieval evaluation fixture.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf () Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Abstract) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Message-passing graph neural networks are the dominant family of models for) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (learning on relational data. This survey consolidates synthetic results) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (reported across the GraphWeave research program, covering benchmark design,) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (the message-passing design space, and the limits of deep architectures. We) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (introduce the GraphWeave benchmark suite as a common yardstick, review) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (aggregation and update functions, and analyze why depth saturates in practice.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (The survey closes with open problems in long-range dependency modelling and) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (evaluation methodology.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf () Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (1 Introduction) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Graph-structured data appears in citation networks, molecules, traffic) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (systems, and program analysis. Over the past decade, message-passing graph) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (neural networks have become the default tool for such data, replacing hand-) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (crafted kernel methods with learned neighbourhood aggregation.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (This survey is organized as follows. Section 2 introduces the GraphWeave) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (benchmark suite. Section 3 reviews the message-passing design space. Section 4) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (analyzes depth-related failure modes. Section 5 lists open problems, and) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Section 6 concludes.) Tj T* ET
