BT 72 720 Td 14 TL /F1 12 Tf (6 Conclusions) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Message-passing graph neural networks are a mature but bounded technology. The) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (GraphWeave benchmark suite provides controlled evidence that depth saturates) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (quickly, that aggregation choice should follow the data-generating process,) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (and that shallow, well-tuned models remain competitive. Future work should) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (target long-range structure without relying on deeper message passing.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf () Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (References) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf ([1] A. Corvin and M. Okafor. The GraphWeave benchmark suite: controlled tasks) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (for graph learning. Journal of Synthetic Graph Learning, 2026. Fictional) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (reference.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf ([2] D. Yilmaz. Depth saturation in message-passing networks. Synthetic) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Workshop on Graph Limits, 2025. Fictional reference.) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf ([3] R. Feld and S. Okonkwo. Aggregation operators revisited. Transactions on) Tj T* /F1 12 Tf (Synthetic Learning, 2024. Fictional reference.) Tj T* ET
